    <briefdescription>
<para>Creates <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_entity_relation" kindref="compound">EntityRelation</ref></computeroutput> edges across two <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_extraction_context" kindref="compound">ExtractionContext</ref></computeroutput>s. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans the entities of both contexts for matching canonical IDs. A match is created when a reference entity in ctx1 (<computeroutput>type == "norm_reference"</computeroutput>) has an ID that equals an entity ID in ctx2, producing a <computeroutput>CITES</computeroutput> edge.</para>
<para>Also matches cross-§ references of the form:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>entity label &quot;§ 3 BImSchG&quot; in ctx1 → entity id &quot;law:bimschg:§3&quot; in ctx2</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_cross_document_linker_1a9b5af7653f181dc7ad38a6eefb5cd9a2" kindref="member">linkDocuments()</ref></computeroutput> is thread-safe (stateless). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
